# Scalar replacement of small fold state (src/wasm.ts `scalarState`): can the state p0 of a body
# live in locals? Register 22 := 0 when not; the chain nodes (updates and rebuilds of the state)
# get bit 1 of their row flags in frame p2. Steps: the state type, then every node, the ret, the
# uses of the chain nodes.

# the state type of the function with first parameter type p2 (tlist p3, types p4): an aggregate of
# at most 8 scalar words; register 24 := its width, 25 := the record's first field and 26 the
# count (0 for an array)
