isa eq tag 4
n select isa a b
nok le n 8
el le b 1
eok select isa el true
o1 and agg nok
ok and o1 eok
okv select ok 1 0
nr select isa 0 b
m1 fold wxs 1 p0 22 okv
m2 fold wxs 1 m1 24 n
m3 fold wxs 1 m2 25 a
m4 fold wxs 1 m3 26 nr
ret m4
end
