# (operands from p5, table p6) as a source (kind 0 local / 1 literal); word k of node j is block
# words 4 + 2k (kind) and 5 + 2k (value)
fn wxwk u32x128x512 u32 u32 u32 u32 u32 u32x128x512 -> u32x128x512
