t0 shr w 18
tot and t0 3
lu and w 65535
user sub lu 1
g0 call wxfg p0 p2 2
rk call wxfg p0 p2 5
rv call wxfg p0 p2 6
r1 eq rk 1
r2 eq rv p3
isret and r1 r2
ug add g0 user
fa call wxnw p4 ug 3
fa1 add fa 1
k1 call wxok p5 fa1
v1 call wxov p5 fa1
